# Region groups for the scenes (Docs/Design/30-towns-and-talk.md; the world of Docs/Design/60, and Ridgemere 3's, doc
# 82): a scene may name a group instead of its towns. Read before every other file.
#
# Ridgemere is the only city: the rain city on its hills above Ridgemere Sound, in the north-west. The towns:
# Frosthollow (the mining village under the Whitefangs' pass), Coldwater (a lakeside village north of Glasswater),
# Oakhaven (at the head of Cedar Sound, under the Rainwood), Larkfield (at the Long River's crossing, among the grain),
# Southmeadow (a hamlet of the warm Sunfields), and the Country's two (doc 72): Fenshore (a stilt hamlet of the Sallow
# Fens) and Saltwell (the oasis hamlet of the Red Waste). Mirebridge, the old fen town, was erased (doc 72): the fens'
# lines are for Fenshore now (`fens`). Fenshore speaks as Mirebridge did and Saltwell as Coldwater (settings.json,
# dialect_of: doc 83, Phase 4).

group cities = ridgemere
group rain_coast = ridgemere
group towns = frosthollow coldwater oakhaven mirebridge larkfield southmeadow fenshore saltwell
group north = ridgemere frosthollow coldwater
group south = oakhaven mirebridge larkfield southmeadow fenshore saltwell
group mountains = frosthollow coldwater
group lake = coldwater
group fens = mirebridge fenshore
group woods = oakhaven
group downs = larkfield southmeadow
group farmland = larkfield southmeadow
group warm = oakhaven mirebridge fenshore
group countryside = oakhaven mirebridge larkfield southmeadow fenshore saltwell
group waste = saltwell
